<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>OvernodeApp-Updater - Inscription Administrateur</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Display', 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; }
    body {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #151d2f 0%, #080b11 80%);
      color: #f1f5f9;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .auth-card {
      background: rgba(19, 26, 42, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 36px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 440px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6), 0 0 30px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
    }
    .logo-container {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
      color: #fbbf24;
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #ffffff;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    p.subtitle {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .console-hint {
      background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.9);
      border: 1px dashed rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.4);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #fbbf24;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      line-height: 1.4;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .alert {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .alert-error {
      background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
      color: #fca5a5;
    }
    .form-group {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    input {
      width: 100%;
      background: rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.8);
      border: 1px solid #29354d;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 11px 14px;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 14px;
      outline: none;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    input:focus {
      border-color: #fbbf24;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
    }
    .code-input {
      font-family: 'SF Mono', Monaco, Menlo, monospace;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #fbbf24;
    }
    button.btn-primary {
      width: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d97706 0%, #fbbf24 100%);
      color: #0f172a;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 12px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.4);
      transition: all 0.2s;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }
    button.btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.5);
    }
    .footer-link {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }
    .footer-link a {
      color: #38bdf8;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .footer-link a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="auth-card">
    <div class="logo-container">
      <div class="badge">SÉCURITÉ CONSOLE</div>
      <h1>Créer un compte</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Accès au portail OvernodeApp-Updater</p>
    </div>

    <div class="console-hint">
      <span>🔑</span>
      <span>Le <strong>code console</strong> est généré et affiché dans les logs du serveur lors du démarrage.</span>
    </div>

    <% if (error) { %>
      <div class="alert alert-error"><%= error %></div>
    <% } %>

    <form action="/auth/register" method="POST">
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="username">Nom d'utilisateur</label>
        <input type="text" id="username" name="username" required placeholder="admin" autofocus>
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="password">Mot de passe</label>
        <input type="password" id="password" name="password" required placeholder="••••••••">
      </div>

      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="consoleCode">Code Console (Vérification serveur)</label>
        <input type="text" id="consoleCode" name="consoleCode" class="code-input" required placeholder="UP-XXXX-XXXX" autocomplete="off">
      </div>

      <button type="submit" class="btn-primary">Valider & S'inscrire</button>
    </form>

    <div class="footer-link">
      Déjà un compte ? <a href="/auth/login">Se connecter</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

